<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 12 ══════════════════ -->
<h2>12. Conclusion</h2>
<p>
  LearnHub is a fully functional Learning Management System that demonstrates a structured, professional
  approach to building multi-role web applications with Laravel. The system successfully implements
  all core LMS functionality: course management, lesson delivery, student enrollment, teacher assignment,
  course reviews, and a comprehensive administration panel.
</p>
<p>
  The platform enforces security best practices through role-based access control, email verification,
  and bcrypt password hashing. The UI is consistent throughout, using a dark navy color scheme across
  all authenticated pages, with a modern split-panel design for the authentication flow.
</p>
<p>
  The project is currently in a complete and functional state. Potential future enhancements could include:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>Video streaming integration for lesson content</li>
  <li>Certificate generation upon course completion</li>
  <li>Progress tracking per lesson</li>
  <li>Real-time notifications using Laravel Echo and Pusher</li>
  <li>Payment gateway integration for premium courses</li>
  <li>Mobile application via a REST API layer</li>
</ul>

<br><br>
<p style="text-align:center; color:#888; font-size:10pt; border-top:1pt solid #ccc; padding-top:10pt;">
  LearnHub LMS — Technical Report &mdash; April 2026
</p>

